SysVeiw is a platform deveped by Harinarayanan TR to help developers enhance their productivity 
such. It can also be treated as a custom terminal interface (CLI) that supports naitive os 
commands and also custom commands. 

Features: 
     -Veiw systme analytics
     -50+commands under development
     -Over The Air hassle free updates  
     -auto bug reporting
     -system hardware and software monitoring
     -optimization
     -naitive system command suport
     -scalable infrastructure
     -React UI
     -and more
